<title>USA: Mercantile files $500 mln debt shelf offer.</title>
<headline>Mercantile files $500 mln debt shelf offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercantile Bancorporation Inc filed Thursday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $500 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>The St. Louis bank holding company said it will use the proceeds from the sale to finance the acquisition of a Missouri-based bank holding company and a savings and loan holding company.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the filing.</p>
</text>
